      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit rewrite (mine loll):\n\nThe pilot draw searches backwards, tail to head, so during the search, any binding matches found *before* a layer execute *after* that draw during rendering. Because existing Opaque shading draws (kColor only) in a layer are guaranteed to be non-intersecting, it is visually safe to extract this match and defer its execution to the new layer without violating painter\u0027s order.",
