                "endLine": 295,
                "endChar": 0
              },
              "replacement": "        //    The new draw searches backwards, tail to head, so during the search, any binding matches\n        //    found *before* a layer execute *after* that draw during rendering. Because existing\n        //    Opaque shading draws (kColor only) in a layer are guaranteed to be non-intersecting,\n        //    it is visually safe to extract this match and defer its execution to the new layer\n        //    without violating the Painter\u0027s Algorithm.\n"
